{
 "hymn": {
  "id": "t3-t026-00015",
  "pie": "h₂éwsos léwka déywi diwés dʰúgh₂ter. n̥sméy léwks sḱih₃wós-kʷe twéd bʰéwgt. nu wiHrṓs twé kʷḱént mudént-kʷe. túH h₂yuHénih₂ túH ń̥dʰgʷʰiteh₂. túH kʷspés swésōr téwe bʰéh₂os h₃kʷbʰós lewbʰóm. nu ḱéywa n̥sméy h₁wésu ḱléwos dh₃dʰí. nu-kʷe n̥sméy ń̥dʰgʷʰitom ḱléwos h₁áydʰi.",
  "english": "Dawn, bright goddess, Daughter of Sky! You shone for us, and darkness fled from you. Men caught sight of you and became glad. You are young, you are imperishable. You are the sister of the night. Your radiance is dear to the eyes. Give us good fame, dear one! And give us imperishable fame!",
